{"id":"630931","name":"三合面枣馒头","author":"厨色","authorId":"12901915","desc":"","cover":"images/630931/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"中筋面粉","amount":"300克"},{"name":"黑米面","amount":"150克"},{"name":"玉米面","amount":"100克"}],"sub":[{"name":"酵母粉","amount":"5克"},{"name":"红枣","amount":"250克"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"三种面粉备好。","img":"images/630931/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"添加酵母粉。","img":"images/630931/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"放入白糖拌匀。","img":"images/630931/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"温水和面。","img":"images/630931/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"和成软硬适中的面团，静置发酵。","img":"images/630931/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"有了很多的气孔，表明面已发好。","img":"images/630931/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"取一份，卷上红枣。","img":"images/630931/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"边揉边放入红枣。","img":"images/630931/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"整理成圆形的馒头。","img":"images/630931/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放入蒸锅，再次饧面发酵。","img":"images/630931/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"二次发酵后，蒸制20分，焖3分钟出锅。","img":"images/630931/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"香甜暄软。","img":"images/630931/step_12.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}